<title>USA: PCX to trade DT Industries options from July 11.</title>
<headline>PCX to trade DT Industries options from July 11.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Exchange said Wednesday it will list options on shares of DT Industries Inc on July 11.</p>
<p>The options will have opening strike prices of 30, 35 and 40 and initial expirations in August, September, December and March. Position limits have been set at 4,500 contracts.</p>
<p>The options have been allocated to lead market maker Sheldon Kahn, the exchange said.</p>
<p>DT options will also be available at the Philadelphia Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
